        "intro_heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Founded in 2018, Aeris is a modern beauty brand devoted to the tools of beauty.</strong>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_color": ""
          }
        },
        "intro_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The beauty world has long obsessed over what goes on the skin, while the tools used to apply it were treated as an afterthought: mass-made, quickly replaced, rarely loved. Aeris was created to change that, with tools designed with the care usually reserved for fine objects.</p>"
