            "enable_highlight_text_color": false,
            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "story_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For many of us, our mornings begin the same way: our reflection in the mirror, a brush in hand, and a choice about who we'll be today.</p><p>A brush becomes - inevitably - the most intimate object we own. We hold it every day, against our skin. It changes how we look and, more importantly, how we feel.</p><p>That is why we started Aeris: to create tools worthy of that ritual, made the way an heirloom is made - to be kept, not replaced.</p><p>We refine the weight and balance in your hand, and the bristles until they feel as soft on the 100th morning as on the first. Today, that same care goes into everything we make, from the brushes on your vanity to the case that holds it all. We care about details you may never notice, only feel.</p><p>Tools are all we make, and we make them with obsession. <em>Elevate your everyday™</em>.</p><p><em>— Patricia Davina, Founder</em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
